eor:sensor.2f146bf3-f7e9-48ba-8749-ef04c14558b3 a eo-ont:Sensor ;
    rdfs:label "ASTER"@en ;
    schema:alternateName "Advanced Spaceborne Thermal Emission and Reflection Radiometer"@en,
        "Advanced Spaceborne Thermal Emission and Reflection radiometer "@en ;
    schema:description "High-resolution land and vegetation observation"@en,
        "Surface and cloud imaging with high spatial resolution, stereoscopic observation of local topography, cloud heights, volcanic plumes, and generation of local surface digital elevation maps. Surface temperature and emissivity. ASTER SWIR detectors are no longer functioning due to anomalously high SWIR detector temperatures. ASTER SWIR data acquired since April 2008 are not useable, and show saturation of values and severe striping. All attempts to bring the SWIR bands back to life have failed, and no further action is envisioned."@en,
        "VNIR and SWIR pushbroom; 4000 pixel/line (VNIR), 2000 pixel/line (SWIR); TIR whiskbroom  (670 pixel/line;  swath 60 km s.s.p.; cross-track pointing capability within a range of  ± 318 km (VNIR) or ± 116 km (SWIR and TIR); along-track stereoscopic viewing in one NIR channel (0.81 µm)"@en ;
    schema:name "ASTER"@en ;
    eo-ont:dataFormat "HDF-EOS or GeoTiff" ;
    eo-ont:geometry eor:geometry.Pushbroom,
