        "Temperature sounding through cloud up to 20 km in altitude. Nearly-all-weather atmospheric temperature profile. 4-channel MW radiometer operating in the 54 GHz band. Follow-on of NEMS flown on Nimbus-5 and SCAMS flown on Nimbus-6. Part of the TOVS package (TIROS Operational Vertical Sounder)."@en ;
